2026-07-27T09:04:00.9613153Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T09:04:00.9613830Z i /tmp/RtmpZ8I6CK/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:04:00.9614310Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:04:00.9614623Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:04:00.9615203Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:04:00.9615634Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:04:00.9616262Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:04:00.9616739Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T09:04:00.9840614Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T09:04:00.9938814Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T09:04:01.0315222Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T09:04:01.0436351Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
